WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.340
Final year or pre-final, the days are full.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.920
Classes, DSA, projects.

3
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.200
And somewhere in between,

4
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.920
you're supposed to find a job,

5
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.120
or an internship.

6
00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.599
Most openings reach you late.

7
00:00:14.859 --> 00:00:15.779
Forwarded by a friend.

8
00:00:15.979 --> 00:00:17.459
Posted on a placement page.

9
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:18.679
Forty careers tabs.

10
00:00:18.939 --> 00:00:20.879
By the time you find the right one,

11
00:00:20.999 --> 00:00:21.999
the form has closed.

12
00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.814
And everyone says: email the recruiter.

13
00:00:26.194 --> 00:00:26.934
But whose email?

14
00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:28.194
What do you even write?

15
00:00:28.374 --> 00:00:29.674
Who has time to send fifty?

16
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.220
That's where Outmail comes in.

17
00:00:33.444 --> 00:00:34.564
Off-campus jobs and

18
00:00:34.584 --> 00:00:37.464
internships from across India, in one place,

19
00:00:37.484 --> 00:00:39.464
matched to your resume.

20
00:00:39.964 --> 00:00:42.224
Every listing is checked by a real person.

21
00:00:43.207 --> 00:00:44.127
Every week,

22
00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:45.967
Outmail writes personal emails to

23
00:00:45.987 --> 00:00:47.407
recruiters hiring in your field,

24
00:00:47.427 --> 00:00:49.587
and sends them from your own Gmail.

25
00:00:50.047 --> 00:00:53.187
So any reply lands right in your inbox.

26
00:00:54.317 --> 00:00:55.657
And when you apply,

27
00:00:55.837 --> 00:00:57.337
the Outmail extension fills

28
00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:58.737
the form in one click.

29
00:00:59.896 --> 00:01:01.796
Don't let the next opening pass you by.

30
00:01:01.996 --> 00:01:03.336
Make your off-campus hunt structured,

31
00:01:03.356 --> 00:01:04.656
starting this week.

32
00:01:05.209 --> 00:01:06.769
Outmail gives you better chances,

33
00:01:06.789 --> 00:01:09.189
and your time back to prepare.
